        Release(version: "2.21 (101)", date: "28 November 2026", headline: "Make a new plan moved to Settings, and the Year view outlines every season bar", items: [
            "Make a new plan · Moved. Before: a full-colour amber button, Make a new plan (or Your new plan (draft) once a draft existed), stood on the wide Plan page under the heading (iPad and Mac), and on iPhone in the row of small word buttons on the Sessions tab. Now: it is gone from both places. It is a row in Settings → Your plan, right under My week shape, with an arrow, on iPhone, iPad and Mac alike. Its grey line says: A draft of a new season beside your plan — you switch when you choose. Once a draft exists the row reads Your new plan (draft), with the grey line: Ready to look at — your plan stays until you switch. The row shows only while your plan lives in the app.",
