        Release(version: "2.19.2 (97)", date: "27 November 2026", headline: "Routes card: a bigger map on iPad and Mac", items: [
            "Routes · Changed: the map on the Routes card is taller on iPad and Mac. Before (2.19): the small map on the Progress › Routes card was 140 points tall on every device, so on the wide iPad and Mac page it was a long thin strip and the routes looked tiny. Now: on iPad and Mac the map is 240 points tall, so the routes show at a useful size. On iPhone it stays 140 points, as before.",
